macos-code-signer third-party software licenses
================================================

Generated by scripts/gen-copying.sh from Cargo.lock. Do not edit by hand.

The macos-code-signer binaries statically link the Rust crates below, as
resolved for the aarch64-apple-darwin and x86_64-apple-darwin targets, and
the Rust runtime (see the end of this file). Crates sharing an identical
license file are grouped under one copy of its text, with each crate's
authors, source and license as declared in its Cargo.toml. Where a crate offers a choice of
licenses, the text it is listed under is the license it is distributed under.
The project's own license is in LICENSE and NOTICE, not listed here.

